      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd really love to have this. It's a design thing. I'd use this to improve user experience.\nFor example, I'd be much more willing to grant global world controls to users in a private instance. Things like music toggles, atmosphere controls, etc. I wouldn't want to give that power to people in public instances, but I want to be able to give users control of their experience while maintaining a shared experience.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
