      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would be a little concerned with this about what happens if new instance types are introduced in the future. It might be better to structure this as a boolean private/public distinction (with f+ being public - since theoretically the set of people who can join is unbounded).",
      "viewerReactions": null
